dges from 632 and 765 (step_05, step_07, step_09). Temporally, the 1885->749 event falls in [22884,23483] (step_06, step_11, step_13, step_14). For the 600-unit relay constraint to be met, 749 would need an outgoing event by at most 23483+600 = 24083, but 749 records zero events in [23484,24083] (step_13) \u2014 its single event in the earlier bucket is the incoming contact from 1885. The chain therefore breaks at the very first hop, and the remaining downstream activity of 1453/1871/632/1460 (step_12) cannot be reached in a time-respecting way. Confounder controls: the window is busy overall (2596 events, 1612 active nodes, step_01) and a static multi-hop connection exists (step_10), but neither yields a valid temporal path; hub 749's high degree (step_08) likewise does not create one.", "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_05", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_07", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_06", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_11", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_14", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_10", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_15", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_16", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_08", "role": "confounder_control"}]}, "raw_final_response": "```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_84b4fde6\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [1885, 1460],\n  \"window\": [15683, 30083],\n  \"confidence\": 0.82,\n  \"narrative\": \"Node 1885 is extremely sparse in this window: only 2 events, to 749 and 1781 (step_02, step_03). The 1781 branch is a dead end (1781's only other partner is 1159, whose only partner is 1781), so any influence path must start with 1885->749. Ignoring time, the sole route to 1460 is 1885->749->1453->1871->632->1460 (step_03, step_10, step_15, step_16); 1460 itself only has in-edges from 632 and 765 (step_05, step_07, step_09). Temporally, the 1885->749 event falls in [22884,23483] (step_06, step_11, step_13, step_14). For the 600-unit relay constraint to be met, 749 would need an outgoing event by at most 23483+600 = 24083, but 749 records zero events in [23484,24083] (step_13) \u2014 its single event in the earlier bucket is the incoming contact from 1885. The chain therefore breaks at the very first hop, and the remaining downstream activity of 1453/1871/632/1460 (step_12) cannot be reached in a time-respecting way. Confounder controls: the window is busy overall (2596 events, 1612 active nodes, step_01) and a static multi-hop connection exists (step_10), but neither yields a valid temporal path; hub 749's high degree (step_08) likewise does not create one.\"\n  ,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_14\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 49712, "total_output_tokens": 6379, "total_tokens": 56091, "total_latency_ms": 86083, "llm_calls": 8, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}